# FX automation on every track: REC held + a FX knob (TONE, DEPTH, SPACE, SEND; TYPE's second knob) records a curve (T_FXA 13, T_FXAMT 12, T_REV 15, T_ECHO 16, T_FXB 14)
wait 300
demo
wait 100
tap PLAY
wait 500
turn SELECT -8
wait 100
